{"version":1,"key":"card:305","content":{"id":305,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个代码格式化工具，它的目的是让人们不在为代码风格而进行争辩，因此它提供了很少的选项去配置代码风格（否则人们又会为代码风格进行争论，离它的目标不符）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"npm install prettier --save-dev --save-exact","language":"shell","uuid":"98c377f4-8321-4896-aa53-a867ae68fcb3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"—save-exact","code":true},{"text":"选项指示下载精确固定的版本，而不是符合语义化的版本，因为即使是小版本的不同，","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 格式化的代码也可能有区分，因此确保大家用的都是同一版本，否则合并时可能会有冲突。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在项目的根目录下创建 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的配置文件，虽然提供的选项很少，但由于历史原因，还是提供了一些选项进行配置。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供了很多种方式进行配置："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"package.json","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字段"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":".prettierrc","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":".prettierrc.json(5)/.prettierrc.y(a)ml","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":".prettierrc.js","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"..."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其配置内容及优先级见"},{"type":"link","url":"https://prettier.io/docs/en/configuration","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文档"}]},{"text":"，基本没什么需要配置的。","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// .prettier.mjs\n\n/** @type {import(\"prettier\").Config} */\nconst config = {\n  trailingComma: \"es5\",\n  tabWidth: 4,\n  semi: false,\n  singleQuote: true,\n};\n\nexport default config;","language":"js","uuid":"d9c48541-e601-4877-94c4-2b8ca70aab45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以新建 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".prettierignore","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件来配置需要忽略的内容，有些文件是不需要格式化的，例如构建产物，其语法规划同 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".gitignore","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"**/.git\n**/node_modules\n**/dist","language":"","uuid":"ea433009-55d0-45a6-bcfa-93d2a44d547c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置完成后，可以通过运行 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"npx prettier --write .","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行格式化，它会尝试对当前目录下的所有文件进行格式化。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在项目中除了使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行格式化，还会使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"eslint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"stylelint","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等 linter 工具进行格式化，它们有什么区别呢？linter 工具主要是包含两部分："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码风格"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码质量"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 主要关注代码风格。既然二者在代码风格有所重合，那么就会有所冲突，为了解决冲突，可以使用下面的配置"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"eslint-config-prettier","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"stylelint-config-prettier","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它们会关闭与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"prettier","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 冲突或不必要的规则。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://prettier.io/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Prettier 官网"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1693225932196,"updateTime":1743303640424,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640424}}